# headwear/helm/crest/horns: the forge crest accent `horns` (STYLE_P2 28.3, contracts 3c: overlay crest.<v>, anchor crown)
# Two horns (the peoples who wear horned helms) springing from the dome's shoulders, curving out and up past the dome,
# in horn (lit along the top, dark at the root); in profile the near horn sweeps forward over the brow.
# Written by the FORGE-HELM area's tools/gen.py from src/ (the hand-drawn D U R views; L is R re-lit). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
body adult
role overlay crest.horns
layer headwear
anchor crown
keys hatpose
z 2
tags overlay
legend v metal 0
legend w metal 1
legend x metal 2
legend y metal 3
legend z metal 4
